<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<title>New Customer Onboarding Review — Adaptive Security</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;700&family=DM+Serif+Display&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root {
  --bg:#F7F5F0; --ink:#1A1814; --ink-muted:#6B6760; --ink-faint:#C4C1BB;
  --rule:#E2DED8; --accent:#2B4FFF; --accent-light:#EEF1FF;
  --c1:#2B4FFF; --c1-bg:#E8EEF9;
  --c2:#1A7A4A; --c2-bg:#E9F4EE;
  --c3:#C85A00; --c3-bg:#FFF3E8;
  --c4:#7B35C2; --c4-bg:#F3EBF9;
  --c5:#A07A10; --c5-bg:#FFF8E6;
  --c6:#0B7EA6; --c6-bg:#EBF6F9;
}
* { box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0; }
html { scroll-behavior:smooth; }
body { font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink); font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; }
.container { max-width:1060px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 48px 80px; }

/* Header */
.page-header { padding:48px 0 36px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule); margin-bottom:48px; }
.header-eyebrow { font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:10px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.14em; color:var(--ink-muted); margin-bottom:12px; }
.header-title { font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif; font-size:38px; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:-.025em; line-height:1.2; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:10px; }
.header-sub { font-size:14px; color:var(--ink-muted); max-width:680px; line-height:1.6; margin-bottom:28px; }

/* Stat cards */
.stat-row { display:flex; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.stat-card { background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--rule); border-radius:10px; padding:16px 20px; min-width:140px; }
.stat-value { font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif; font-size:32px; font-weight:400; color:var(--ink); line-height:1.1; }
.stat-value sup { font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:var(--ink-muted); font-weight:400; }
.stat-label { font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:9px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.12em; color:var(--ink-muted); margin-top:5px; line-height:1.4; }
.stat-card.highlight { background:var(--c1-bg); border-color:transparent; }
.stat-card.highlight .stat-value { color:var(--c1); }
.stat-card.green { background:var(--c2-bg); border-color:transparent; }
.stat-card.green .stat-value { color:var(--c2); }

/* Section */
.section { margin-bottom:56px; }
.section-header { margin-bottom:24px; padding-bottom:14px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule); }
.section-num { font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.14em; color:var(--ink); display:block; margin-bottom:8px; }
.section-heading { font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif; font-size:22px; font-weight:400; color:var(--ink); line-height:1.3; margin-bottom:4px; }
.section-tagline { font-size:13px; color:var(--ink-muted); line-height:1.55; }
.section-body { font-size:14px; color:var(--ink-muted); line-height:1.65; margin-bottom:16px; }

/* Layout */
.two-col { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:16px; }
.three-col { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr; gap:12px; }

/* Cards */
.detail-block { background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--rule); border-radius:10px; padding:20px 22px; }
.block-label { font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:9px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.12em; color:var(--ink-muted); margin-bottom:14px; display:block; }
.block-title { font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:400; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:6px; }
.block-body { font-size:13px; color:var(--ink-muted); line-height:1.6; }

/* Focus cards */
.focus-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:12px; }
.focus-grid.thirds { grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); }
.focus-card { border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; }
.focus-card.c1 { background:var(--c1-bg); }
.focus-card.c2 { background:var(--c2-bg); }
.focus-card.c3 { background:var(--c3-bg); }
.focus-card.c4 { background:var(--c4-bg); }
.focus-card.c5 { background:var(--c5-bg); }
.focus-card.c6 { background:var(--c6-bg); }
.card-body { padding:16px 18px 18px; }
.card-top { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:5px; }
.card-number { font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:10px; color:var(--ink-muted); }
.card-dot { width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%; flex-shrink:0; margin-top:3px; }
.c1 .card-dot { background:var(--c1); }
.c2 .card-dot { background:var(--c2); }
.c3 .card-dot { background:var(--c3); }
.c4 .card-dot { background:var(--c4); }
.c5 .card-dot { background:var(--c5); }
.c6 .card-dot { background:var(--c6); }
.card-title { font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:400; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:6px; }
.card-desc { font-size:12px; color:#555; line-height:1.6; margin-bottom:10px; }
.card-themes { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:4px; }
.theme-tag { font-size:10px; font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; padding:2px 7px; border-radius:4px; background:rgba(0,0,0,.07); color:var(--ink); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.04em; }

@keyframes fadeUp { from { opacity:0; transform:translateY(8px); } to { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); } }
.focus-card { animation:fadeUp .3s ease both; }
.focus-card:nth-child(1) { animation-delay:.04s; }
.focus-card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay:.08s; }
.focus-card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay:.12s; }
.focus-card:nth-child(4) { animation-delay:.16s; }

/* Rating bars */
.rating-chart { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:6px; }
.rating-row { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; }
.rating-num { font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; color:var(--ink-muted); width:20px; text-align:right; flex-shrink:0; }
.rating-track { flex:1; background:var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--rule); border-radius:4px; height:20px; overflow:hidden; }
.rating-fill { height:100%; border-radius:3px; display:flex; align-items:center; padding-left:7px; }
.rating-count { font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:10px; color:#fff; }
.rating-note { font-size:11px; color:var(--ink-muted); margin-left:4px; white-space:nowrap; }
.bf-c1 { background:var(--c1); }
.bf-c2 { background:var(--c2); }
.bf-c3 { background:var(--c3); }
.bf-c4 { background:var(--c4); }
.bf-c5 { background:var(--c5); }
.bf-c6 { background:var(--c6); }
.bf-faint { background:var(--ink-faint); }

/* Bar charts */
.bar-chart { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0; }
.bar-item { border-radius:6px; overflow:hidden; margin-bottom:6px; }
.bar-item:last-child { margin-bottom:0; }
.bar-row { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; padding:4px 6px; cursor:pointer; border-radius:6px; transition:background .15s; }
.bar-row:hover { background:rgba(0,0,0,.04); }
.bar-row.active { background:rgba(0,0,0,.04); }
.bar-label { font-size:12px; color:var(--ink); width:210px; flex-shrink:0; text-align:right; line-height:1.35; }
.bar-track { flex:1; background:var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--rule); border-radius:4px; height:22px; overflow:hidden; }
.bar-fill { height:100%; border-radius:3px; display:flex; align-items:center; padding-left:8px; min-width:28px; }
.bar-pct { font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:10px; font-weight:500; color:#fff; white-space:nowrap; }
.bar-toggle { font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:9px; color:var(--ink-faint); white-space:nowrap; flex-shrink:0; margin-left:4px; transition:color .15s; }
.bar-row:hover .bar-toggle, .bar-row.active .bar-toggle { color:var(--c1); }

/* Quote drawer */
.quote-drawer { display:none; padding:12px 16px 14px; background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--rule); border-top:none; border-radius:0 0 6px 6px; margin-top:-2px; }
.quote-drawer.open { display:block; }
.drawer-quote { padding:8px 12px; border-left:2px solid var(--rule); margin-bottom:8px; }
.drawer-quote:last-child { margin-bottom:0; }
.drawer-quote-text { font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-muted); line-height:1.6; font-style:italic; display:block; }
.drawer-quote-cite { font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:9px; color:var(--ink-faint); display:block; margin-top:4px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.08em; }
.drawer-score { display:inline-block; font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:9px; padding:1px 6px; border-radius:3px; margin-right:6px; }
.score-7 { background:var(--c3-bg); color:var(--c3); }
.score-8 { background:var(--c5-bg); color:var(--c5); }
.score-5 { background:var(--c3-bg); color:var(--c3); }

/* Quotes */
.quote-block { border-left:2px solid var(--rule); padding:10px 16px; margin:12px 0; }
.quote-text { font-size:13px; color:var(--ink-muted); line-height:1.65; font-style:italic; display:block; }
.quote-cite { font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:9px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.1em; color:var(--ink-faint); display:block; margin-top:5px; }

/* Quote contrast */
.quote-contrast { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:12px; margin-top:16px; }
.quote-contrast-card { border-radius:8px; padding:14px 16px; }
.quote-contrast-card.high { background:var(--c2-bg); border:1px solid rgba(26,122,74,.12); }
.quote-contrast-card.low { background:var(--c3-bg); border:1px solid rgba(200,90,0,.12); }
.quote-contrast-card.neutral { background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--rule); }
.qc-badge { font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:9px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.12em; margin-bottom:8px; display:block; }
.qc-badge.high { color:var(--c2); }
.qc-badge.low { color:var(--c3); }
.qc-badge.neutral { color:var(--ink-muted); }
.qc-text { font-size:12px; color:var(--ink); line-height:1.6; font-style:italic; }
.qc-cite { font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:9px; color:var(--ink-faint); display:block; margin-top:6px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.1em; }

/* Accent blocks */
.accent-block { background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--rule); border-left:3px solid var(--c1); border-radius:10px; padding:18px 20px; margin-bottom:14px; }
.accent-block.c2-border { border-left-color:var(--c2); }
.accent-block.c3-border { border-left-color:var(--c3); }
.accent-block.c4-border { border-left-color:var(--c4); }
.accent-block.c5-border { border-left-color:var(--c5); }

/* Avg callout */
.avg-callout { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; background:var(--c2-bg); border:1px solid rgba(26,122,74,.15); border-radius:8px; padding:10px 16px; margin-bottom:14px; }
.avg-num { font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif; font-size:24px; color:var(--c2); }
.avg-label { font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:9px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.1em; color:var(--ink-muted); line-height:1.5; }

/* Engagement cards */
.eng-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:12px; }
.eng-card { background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--rule); border-radius:10px; padding:18px 20px; text-align:center; }
.eng-value { font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif; font-size:36px; font-weight:400; color:var(--c2); line-height:1.1; }
.eng-label { font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:9px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.12em; color:var(--ink-muted); margin-top:6px; line-height:1.5; }

/* Source bar */
.source-bar { border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule); padding-bottom:16px; margin-bottom:36px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:20px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.source-label { font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:9px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.14em; color:var(--ink-faint); flex-shrink:0; }
.source-links { display:flex; gap:16px; }
.source-link { font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:10px; color:var(--c1); text-decoration:none; letter-spacing:.04em; }
.source-link:hover { text-decoration:underline; }

/* Divider */
.section-divider { border:none; border-top:2px solid var(--rule); margin:56px 0; }

/* Footer */
.page-footer { border-top:1px solid var(--rule); padding-top:20px; margin-top:20px; }
.footer-text { font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:10px; color:var(--ink-faint); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.1em; line-height:1.8; }

/* Toc */
.toc { display:flex; gap:24px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:40px; padding-bottom:16px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule); }
.toc-link { font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:10px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.1em; color:var(--ink-muted); text-decoration:none; }
.toc-link:hover { color:var(--c1); }

/* Quote stack */
.quote-stack { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:2px; }

@media(max-width:860px) {
  .container { padding:0 20px 60px; }
  .two-col, .focus-grid, .focus-grid.thirds, .quote-contrast, .three-col, .eng-row { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .bar-label { width:140px; font-size:11px; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">

  <!-- HEADER -->
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="header-eyebrow">Adaptive Security · Platform BU · Post-Onboarding Review</div>
    <h1 class="header-title">New Customer Onboarding Review</h1>
    <p class="header-sub">283 customers surveyed immediately following onboarding completion. Respondents include CISOs, IT Directors, Security Engineers, and C-Suite leaders. Fielded 2024–2025.</p>
    <div class="source-bar">
      <span class="source-label">Source</span>
      <div class="source-links">
        <a class="source-link" href="#">↗ Raw survey data (CSV)</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-row">
      <div class="stat-card green">
        <div class="stat-value">9.6<sup>/10</sup></div>
        <div class="stat-label">Avg. onboarding score</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-value">90%</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Rated onboarding 9 or 10</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-value">73%</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Gave a perfect 10</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-value">26</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Rated below 9 — all with specific, named reasons</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-value">283</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Total respondents</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- TOC -->
  <nav class="toc">
    <a class="toc-link" href="#scores">01 Score Distribution</a>
    <a class="toc-link" href="#what-works">02 What Good Looks Like</a>
    <a class="toc-link" href="#friction">03 Where It Falls Short</a>
    <a class="toc-link" href="#success">04 What Success Means to Them</a>
    <a class="toc-link" href="#help">05 What They Need From Us</a>
    <a class="toc-link" href="#features">06 Product Gaps Surfaced in Onboarding</a>
    <a class="toc-link" href="#sales">07 Sales Signal</a>
  </nav>

  <!-- SECTION 1: SCORES -->
  <div class="section" id="scores">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-num">01 — Onboarding Score Distribution</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading">9.6 average, with 90% rating 9 or above. Every low score has a named cause.</h2>
      <p class="section-tagline">The signal in the lower scores is unusually clean. Customers who rated below 9 did not give vague feedback — they pointed to SCIM failures, a feeling of being left on their own post-kickoff, or AI capabilities that required Adaptive team involvement to use.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="two-col">
      <div class="detail-block">
        <span class="block-label">Onboarding Score Distribution — n=272</span>
        <div class="avg-callout">
          <div class="avg-num">9.6</div>
          <div class="avg-label">Average score<br>90% rated 9 or 10</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rating-chart">
          <div class="rating-row"><div class="rating-num">10</div><div class="rating-track"><div class="rating-fill bf-c2" style="width:72.8%;"><span class="rating-count">198</span></div></div><span class="rating-note" style="font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);">72.8%</span></div>
          <div class="rating-row"><div class="rating-num">9</div><div class="rating-track"><div class="rating-fill bf-c2" style="width:16.9%;"><span class="rating-count">46</span></div></div><span class="rating-note">16.9%</span></div>
          <div class="rating-row"><div class="rating-num">8</div><div class="rating-track"><div class="rating-fill bf-c6" style="width:5.5%;"><span class="rating-count" style="color:#fff;font-size:9px;">15</span></div></div><span class="rating-note">5.5%</span></div>
          <div class="rating-row"><div class="rating-num">7</div><div class="rating-track"><div class="rating-fill bf-c3" style="width:4.4%;"></div></div><span class="rating-note">4.4% · 12 respondents</span></div>
          <div class="rating-row"><div class="rating-num">5</div><div class="rating-track"><div class="rating-fill bf-faint" style="width:0.4%;"></div></div><span class="rating-note">0.4% · 1 respondent</span></div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:14px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-muted);">
          26 respondents below 9 · All cited specific, addressable causes
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="detail-block" style="margin-bottom:16px;">
          <span class="block-label">What caused lower scores — top patterns <span style="font-weight:400;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;color:var(--ink-faint);">· click any row to see quotes</span></span>
          <div class="bar-chart">

            <div class="bar-item">
              <div class="bar-row" onclick="toggleDrawer('drawer-kickoff', this)">
                <div class="bar-label" style="width:200px;">"Good kickoff, then on my own"</div>
                <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill bf-c3" style="width:62%;"><span class="bar-pct">Most common</span></div></div>
                <span class="bar-toggle">▸ quotes</span>
              </div>
              <div class="quote-drawer" id="drawer-kickoff">
                <div class="drawer-quote">
                  <span class="drawer-quote-text"><span class="drawer-score score-5">5/10</span>"Had an onboarding session which was good and fast, but implementation has been all on me."</span>
                  <span class="drawer-quote-cite">Sports Facilities Companies · IT Director</span>
                </div>
                <div class="drawer-quote">
                  <span class="drawer-quote-text"><span class="drawer-score score-8">8/10</span>"Onboarding went well but it did feel a bit 'follow this guide, good luck.' Setting up our SSO and SCIM ingestion during the call would have been more helpful."</span>
                  <span class="drawer-quote-cite">Bentley University · Senior Cybersecurity Engineer</span>
                </div>
                <div class="drawer-quote">
                  <span class="drawer-quote-text"><span class="drawer-score score-7">7/10</span>"It was good but also very hurried. More time on launching the product could have helped."</span>
                  <span class="drawer-quote-cite">Easy Auto Credit · Senior IT and Cybersecurity Engineer</span>
                </div>
                <div class="drawer-quote">
                  <span class="drawer-quote-text"><span class="drawer-score score-7">7/10</span>"I would have liked some hands-on components to it as we are learning the tool."</span>
                  <span class="drawer-quote-cite">Tegria · HR Director</span>
                </div>
                <div class="drawer-quote">
                  <span class="drawer-quote-text"><span class="drawer-score score-8">8/10</span>"Onboarding was ok. Was expecting a little more, but the product is pretty intuitive."</span>
                  <span class="drawer-quote-cite">Oxford Global Resources · Emperor of all Network Land</span>
                </div>
                <div class="drawer-quote">
                  <span class="drawer-quote-text"><span class="drawer-score score-8">8/10</span>"This was an extended demo but I now had administrative access to the platform. The meeting showed me around the application... I would have liked to see a more structured, hands-on onboarding."</span>
                  <span class="drawer-quote-cite">Legend Energy Advisors · Director of Field Services</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bar-item">
              <div class="bar-row" onclick="toggleDrawer('drawer-scim', this)">
                <div class="bar-label" style="width:200px;">SCIM / IdP integration failures</div>
                <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill bf-c3" style="width:46%;"><span class="bar-pct">Frequent</span></div></div>
                <span class="bar-toggle">▸ quotes</span>
              </div>
              <div class="quote-drawer" id="drawer-scim">
                <div class="drawer-quote">
                  <span class="drawer-quote-text"><span class="drawer-score score-7">7/10</span>"SCIM fails to import data from Okta."</span>
                  <span class="drawer-quote-cite">Alloy · IT and Security Manager</span>
                </div>
                <div class="drawer-quote">
                  <span class="drawer-quote-text"><span class="drawer-score score-8">8/10</span>"We had some issues with SCIM integration and had to wait a long time for the support team to respond. It may be because of the time difference, but we expect at least a response within 1–2 hours."</span>
                  <span class="drawer-quote-cite">FSC · Consultant</span>
                </div>
                <div class="drawer-quote">
                  <span class="drawer-quote-text"><span class="drawer-score score-8">8/10</span>"Setting up our SSO and SCIM ingestion during our onboarding call would have been helpful — instead it was left as a follow-up item."</span>
                  <span class="drawer-quote-cite">Bentley University · Senior Cybersecurity Engineer</span>
                </div>
                <div class="drawer-quote">
                  <span class="drawer-quote-text"><span class="drawer-score score-7">7/10</span>"Could improve on some of the tech implementation."</span>
                  <span class="drawer-quote-cite">Jasper Ridge Partners · Senior Infrastructure Security Engineer</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bar-item">
              <div class="bar-row" onclick="toggleDrawer('drawer-ai', this)">
                <div class="bar-label" style="width:200px;">AI features felt team-dependent</div>
                <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill bf-c5" style="width:31%;"><span class="bar-pct">Common</span></div></div>
