        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="card-top"><span class="card-number">01</span><div class="card-dot"></div></div>
          <div class="card-title">Measurable reduction in employee risk</div>
          <div class="card-desc">Reduced phishing click rates, improved simulation pass rates, declining "risky" user counts. Customers want to show a trend line to leadership. The most sophisticated respondents want this to tie to real-world phishing reports, not just sim performance.</div>
