          <div class="card-desc">High completion rates matter, but customers frequently qualify this: completion without engagement is hollow. Several mentioned wanting training that employees actually find useful, not something they click through to clear a due date. Engagement signals — revisits, voluntary completions — came up as the real metric.</div>
          <div class="card-themes"><span class="theme-tag">Completion</span><span class="theme-tag">Engagement</span><span class="theme-tag">End-user experience</span></div>
