          <div class="block-title">Best practice guidance, not just product support</div>
          <div class="block-body">Customers want to know what the best-run programs look like. "Provide ongoing benchmark to what other organizations of our size are doing." Several asked for curated recommendations: which templates to start with, how to structure a first campaign, how to handle employees who repeatedly fail. This is a post-onboarding CSM problem as much as a product problem.</div>
