        <div class="accent-block c1-border">
          <div class="block-title">Content that evolves with the threat landscape</div>
          <div class="block-body">The ask for content freshness came up in both the concerns section and the help section. Customers frame it as: they need to be able to tell employees "this is what attackers are doing right now." Content that feels dated undermines the program internally. Several asked for an explicit cadence or a newsletter-style feed of what's new.</div>
