  <!-- SECTION 6: PRODUCT GAPS -->
  <div class="section" id="features">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-num">06 — Product Gaps That Surface During Onboarding</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading">Self-serve deepfakes, SCIM gaps, and reporting all show up before customers have run a single campaign.</h2>
      <p class="section-tagline">These are not distant product requests — they are things customers discover within the first days of setup. The top ask is the ability to create deepfake content without involving the Adaptive team. The second is SCIM reliability. Both directly suppress onboarding scores when absent.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="focus-grid">
      <div class="focus-card c3">
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="card-top"><span class="card-number">01</span><div class="card-dot"></div></div>
          <div class="card-title">Self-Service Deepfake Creation</div>
          <div class="card-desc">The most frequently requested capability, and the clearest onboarding gap. Customers are sold on deepfakes, then discover they need to submit a request to Adaptive to actually create one. Several felt they were still dependent on the team for the flagship feature. The ask is full self-service: upload materials, generate a video, launch the sim.</div>
          <div class="card-themes"><span class="theme-tag">Deepfakes</span><span class="theme-tag">Self-serve</span><span class="theme-tag">Day-1 blocker</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="focus-card c3">
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="card-top"><span class="card-number">02</span><div class="card-dot"></div></div>
          <div class="card-title">SCIM and Integration Reliability</div>
          <div class="card-desc">Okta SCIM failures and missing EntraAD support are the most-named technical blockers. These appear during setup, not later. JumpCloud, Rippling, and Dayforce also show up as missing integrations. Customers who hit these walls during onboarding either wait on support or do manual workarounds — both of which depress scores and erode early trust.</div>
          <div class="card-themes"><span class="theme-tag">SCIM</span><span class="theme-tag">EntraAD</span><span class="theme-tag">Setup blocker</span></div>
