          <div class="card-top"><span class="card-number">03</span><div class="card-dot"></div></div>
          <div class="card-title">Exec-Ready Reporting Out of the Box</div>
          <div class="card-desc">Customers who onboard and then try to show results to leadership hit the reporting gap almost immediately. CSV exports require manual work before they're presentable. The ask is specific: PDF summaries, an email-ready report, or an API to pull completion data into existing workflows. This is also a retention risk — customers who can't demonstrate ROI are harder to renew.</div>
          <div class="card-themes"><span class="theme-tag">Reporting</span><span class="theme-tag">PDF export</span><span class="theme-tag">API</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

